=== Information ===
When she was a child, she was happy and carefree with her adoptive mother, Rena, and stepfather, Andrew.

When her mom and Andrew divorced, she became depressed but still kept in touch with Andrew.

She loves to run and could always be seen on the track. Kelly was always a good runner, but in high school the track coach discovered her and became the school's track star.

When she finds herself on an unfamiliar island, she is forced to make difficult decisions that will decide her future path.

Running forward is built into her mind and body. No matter the obstacle, she will always keep going.

